OL,3,CWilliam and Kate to visit Commonwealth
OL,4,CGames
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales will
OL,7,Fjoin spectators at the Commonwealth
OL,8,FGames in Glasgow as the sporting
OL,9,Ftournament draws to a close.
OL,11,FWilliam and Kate will watch events on
OL,12,Fthe penultimate day of the games which
OL,13,Fhas showcased some of the world's best
OL,14,Fcompetitors and seen thousands flock
OL,15,Fto the city.
