OL,3,CWilliam and Kate to visit Commonwealth
OL,4,CGames
OL,6,FThe royal couple ` who are known by
OL,7,Ftheir Scottish titles, the Duke and
OL,8,FDuchess of Rothesay, when visiting the
OL,9,Fcountry ` will also meet Team Wales
OL,10,Fathletes and their families on
OL,11,FSaturday.
OL,13,FBefore the games William chatted to
OL,14,Ffive Team Wales athletes ` lawn and
OL,15,Findoor bowler Ross Owen, blind para
OL,16,Fbowler Julie Thomas and her guide John
OL,17,FWilson, and weightlifters Madaline
OL,18,FConnelly and Catrin Haf Jones ` when
OL,19,Fhe visited the London Welsh School in
OL,20,FHanwell, west London.
