OL,3,CWilliam and Kate to visit Commonwealth
OL,4,CGames
OL,6,FIn recent days the sporting event
OL,7,Faffectionately known as the "friendly
OL,8,Fgames" has been attended by the Duke
OL,9,Fof Edinburgh, vice patron of
OL,10,FCommonwealth Sport, which delivers the
OL,11,Fgames, and his wife.
OL,13,FOn Saturday spectators can watch a
OL,14,Frange of sports from athletics and
OL,15,Fboxing to netball and judo.
