OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1786191515
OL,3,CWilliam and Kate to visit Commonwealth
OL,4,CGames
OL,6,FThe King and Queen emerged from a
OL,7,FTardis at the Hydro arena in Glasgow
OL,8,Fduring the opening ceremony, in scenes
OL,9,Freminiscent of London 2012 when Queen
OL,10,FElizabeth II appeared to skydive into
OL,11,Fthe Olympic Stadium alongside James
OL,12,FBond actor Daniel Craig.
OL,14,FThe opening ceremony in Glasgow was
OL,15,Fthe first to be held indoors as part
OL,16,Fof a radical restructuring of the
OL,17,Fgames' finances after Australian state
OL,18,FVictoria withdrew as host of the event
OL,19,Fin 2023, citing spiralling costs.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
