OL,3,CWilliam and Kate to visit Commonwealth
OL,4,CGames
OL,6,FThe future of the event, which
OL,7,Foriginated as the British Empire Games
OL,8,Fin 1930, was in doubt until Glasgow
OL,9,Fwas convinced to step in and reprise
OL,10,Fits hosting role from 2014, albeit
OL,11,Fwith significant alterations.
OL,13,FWilliam and Kate will also spend time
OL,14,Fwith athletes competing at the games
OL,15,Fwhose careers have been empowered by
OL,16,Fthe charity SportsAid, which Kate has
OL,17,Fsupported as patron since 2013, and
OL,18,Fmeet emerging talent taking part in
OL,19,Fthe Team England Futures project.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
